ApproveTransfer_Exits_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the caller is not the Safe
│   └── it should revert with OnlyBoard
├── when the transfer was never offered
│   └── it should revert with UnknownTransfer
├── when the transfer was already bought
│   └── it should revert with AlreadyBought
└── when the Board approves an offered sale
    ├── it should mark the transfer approved
    └── it should emit TransferApproved
